e made at the last measurement prior to the first dose of pegcetacoplan (baseline) and periodically throughout the different parts of the treatment period. Haptoglobin results were summarized for Cohort 2 only.","populationDescription":"The ITT population set included all subjects eligible to receive study drug and who received ≥1 dose of study drug. Only subjects analyzed at Day 365 are reported.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"percent change","timeFrame":"Baseline (Day 1) and Day 365.","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Cohort 2","description":"Subjects received SC injections or infusions of pegcetacoplan 270 mg/day for up to 364 days if entering the open-label extension study or, if entering Part 2C, until enrollment in the open-label extension study became available. If clinically indicated on the basis of response, the pegcetacoplan dosage could be increased up to 360 mg/day."}],"denoms":[{"units":"Participants","counts":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"17"}]}],"classes":[{"categories":[{"measurements":[{"groupId":"OG000","value":"166.176","spread":"311.3656"}]}]}]},{"type":"PRIMARY","title":"Mean Change From Baseline in Hemoglobin at Day 365","description":"Hematology assessments of hemoglobin were made at the last measurement prior to the first dose of pegcetacoplan (baseline) and periodically throughout the different parts of the treatment period. Hemoglobin results were summarized for Cohort 2 only.","populationDescription":"The ITT population set included all subjects eligible to receive study drug and who received ≥1 dose of study drug. Only subjects analyzed at Day 365 are reported.","reportingStatus":"POSTED","paramType":"MEAN","dispersionType":"Standard Deviation","unitOfMeasure":"g/L","timeFrame":"Baseline (Day 1) and Day 365.","groups":[{"id":"OG000","title":"Cohort 2","description":"Subjects received SC injections or infusions of pegcetacoplan 270 mg/day for up to 364 days if entering t